seed packet:
- drops 10 seeds under #stardewdelight:seed_packet_options
- most seeds available this way (except e.g. ancient seed, rare seed, qi bean, or very common seeds)
- mainly intended for structure loot, to prevent seeds clogging player inventories

Seed bag (holds 128 items of seeds, up to 12 different stacks)

how get more flower seeds?
rare seed: wandering trader
ancient seed (craftable into ancient seeds): desert temples, archaeology, trial chambers
qi bean: wandering trader
all other seeds: surface features (wild variants), village loot tables (some with fresh produce)


flower textures
seed textures
sapling textures
crate textures
wood decoratives textures
leaves textures
crop block textures

seed maker:
- functions differently from in stardew
- pass in 4 unique seeds, receive 1 different seed back
- available seeds are restricted to those under #stardewdelight:seed_maker_options
- some seeds (rare seed, ancient seeds, qi bean, or very common seeds) are not available this way
- mainly intended to prevent endless searching for one specific crop


actual food recipes




