Forageables:
- Wild seeds (Spring, Summer, Autumn, Winter)
- Forage bag (holds 128 items of forageables, up to 8 different stacks)
- Forage spots that replenish forageables over time, and can be repeatedly harvested.
  Cannot be moved, but should be plentiful in the world (multiple in each biome) and can spawn any of the
  several options for that particular biome.
- Spring biomes:
    - (vanilla) Brown mushrooms
    - Daffodil
    - Dandelion
    - Leek
    - Morel
    - Salmonberry
    - Spring onion
    - Wild horseradish
- Summer biomes:
    - (vanilla) Brown mushrooms
    - Fiddlehead fern
    - Grapes
    - (vanilla) Red mushrooms
    - Spice berry
    - Sweet pea
- Autumnal biomes:
    - Blackberry
    - Chanterelle
    - (vanilla) Brown mushrooms
    - Hazelnut
    - Purple mushroom
    - (vanilla) Red mushrooms
    - Wild plum
- Cold/snowy biomes:
    - Crocus
    - Crystal fruit
    - Holly
    - Snow yam
    - Winter root
- Underground:
    - Cave carrot
    - Purple mushroom
    - (vanilla) Red mushrooms
- Deserts:
    - Cactus fruit
